TEXT -208 -120 Left 2 ;4-wire resistive touch panel (Panel 1), shown in the READ-X phase:
TEXT -208 -92 Left 2 ;XP=HIGH (GPIO32), XM=LOW (GPIO23), Y layer floats, ADC reads V(GPIO33_YP).
TEXT -208 -64 Left 2 ;To read Y: drive YP/YM, float X, read XP. Touch via TOUCH; position via KX/KY.
TEXT -208 -36 Left 2 ;Panel 2 (Mode 2) is identical on GPIO25/26 (X+/Y+) and GPIO21/19 (X-/Y-).
